# Opt-in custom contact filter, ported from upstream b2CustomFilterFcn in
# types.h. The world applies the built-in shape and body rules first and
# consults this hook last, so leaving CustomFilter as Nothing costs nothing.
#
# Return True to let the pair collide, False to suppress the contact. The
# hook runs during broad-phase pair discovery and must not mutate the world.
Class CustomContactFilter
## Returns True when the two shapes may collide.
Function ShouldCollide(shapeA As Shape, shapeB As Shape) As Boolean
Pragma Unused shapeA
Pragma Unused shapeB
Return True
End Function
End Class
